# Keep internal/web/dist/ in git so `//go:embed all:dist` always compiles, even
# on a source checkout where the frontend has not been built. The actual built
# bundle (index.html + assets/) is produced by `make web-build` and is NOT
# committed (see .gitignore). CI and the release pipeline build it before
# `go build`; a source build with only this marker serves a placeholder page.
